{"id":"n74548-1-7","stage":4,"title":"적금 · 储蓄","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74548-1-7-1","ko":"내가 사업 계획은 기가 막힌 게 있는데 말야.","zh":"我有个超级棒的创业计划哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사업","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계획은","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기가","meaning":"气，元气，气势","explanation":"기：气，元气，气势；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기","audio":"/audio/0747eccf912e966bfe3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32480","senseId":"1","lemma":"기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"막힌","meaning":"固执","explanation":"막히다：固执；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"막히다","audio":"/audio/23886d293fd139686d2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29777","senseId":"7","lemma":"막히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말야.","meaning":"不做","explanation":"말다：不做；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term"